{"unit_id":"Carlos5986515__dsh-status-notifier#card-zh","repo":"Carlos5986515/dsh-status-notifier","commit":"559b45b85003740a91d8b94a42dc324274979e81","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Status Notifier 是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 插件，在 macOS 菜单栏展示会话状态并发送通知。Host 端监听审批请求与 agent 运行状态，生成 SwiftBar 菜单脚本和状态文件；Web 客户端在页面隐藏或失焦时提醒待处理审批和已完成会话。菜单列出等待批准、运行中及近期完成的会话，并提供打开 DeepSeek Harness 的入口。适合希望离开窗口时仍能留意任务状态的 macOS 用户。需要 macOS 和 SwiftBar，可配置 SwiftBar 插件目录及状态文件目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:58-80","index.js:137-216","client.js:85-133"]}
{"unit_id":"Carlos5986515__dsh-status-notifier#card-en","repo":"Carlos5986515/dsh-status-notifier","commit":"559b45b85003740a91d8b94a42dc324274979e81","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Status Notifier shows session states in the macOS menu bar. Its Host creates a SwiftBar menu from approval and agent status events; the Web client alerts when sessions need approval or finish while the page is away. Requires macOS and SwiftBar.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:58-80","index.js:137-216","client.js:85-133"]}
