{"unit_id":"Carlos5986515__dsh-status-notifier#feature-1","repo":"Carlos5986515/dsh-status-notifier","commit":"559b45b85003740a91d8b94a42dc324274979e81","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Status Notifier 的功能「菜单栏状态」：在 SwiftBar 菜单中汇总待批准、运行中、近期完成或空闲状态，并列出相关会话。菜单项可用于唤回 DeepSeek Harness。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:150-192"]}
